esign/contracts/v0.1.0/time.pattern.contract.json"}]},{"id":"blk-118187","spans":[{"id":"spn-194573","text":"detect, summarize, enrich"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-118188","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-194574","text":"Key technologies"}]},{"id":"blk-118189","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194575","text":"Selective State-Space Models (Mamba architecture) for anomaly detection"}]}],"id":"blk-118190","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194576","text":"Epoch-aware delta-CRDTs for convergent temporal state"}]}],"id":"blk-118192","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118195","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194577","text":"Multi-timescale consolidation (Nested Learning / Titans-inspired)"}]}],"id":"blk-118194","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194578","text":"Continual Compositionality & Orchestration (CCO)"}]}],"id":"blk-118196","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194579","text":"MCP-first API design"}]}],"id":"blk-118198","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-118200","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-194580","text":"Paired with"}]},{"id":"blk-118201","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194581","marks":["bold"],"text":"GeoFleetic"},{"id":"spn-194582","text":" — spatial intelligence (when + where = complete situational awareness)"}]}],"id":"blk-118202","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194583","marks":["bold"],"text":"Graphonomous"},{"id":"spn-194584","text":" — continual learning substrate"}]}],"id":"blk-118204","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194585","marks":["bold"],"text":"Delegatic"},{"id":"spn-194586","text":" — governance enforcement for temporal operations"}]}],"id":"blk-118206","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-118208","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-194587","text":"Status"}]},{"id":"blk-118209","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194588","text":"This is a spec site. "},{"id":"spn-194589","marks":["bold"],"text":"No implementation code — none, anywhere."},{"id":"spn-194590","text":" "},{"id":"spn-194591","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-194592","text":" recounts that on every run ("},{"id":"spn-194593","marks":["code"],"text":".ex"},{"id":"spn-194594","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-194595","marks":["code"],"text":".exs"},{"id":"spn-194596","text":" lines outside "},{"id":"spn-194597","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scraps/"},{"id":"spn-194598","text":") and the page publishes the number. The nine figures in §10 of the spec are "},{"id":"spn-194599","marks":["bold"],"text":"targets"},{"id":"spn-194600","text":", and three of them were published on the landing page as statistics until 2026-08-17; see the retraction. Implementation will be Elixir/OTP when it starts; the nearest honest first step is the spec's own "},{"id":"spn-194601","marks":["bold"],"text":"FV-2"},{"id":"spn-194602","text":", the multi-timescale consolidation prototype, because it needs no model and no dataset."}]},{"id":"blk-118210","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-194603","text":"The landing page is GENERATED. Do not hand-edit "},{"id":"spn-194604","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-194605","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-118211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194606","marks":["code"],"text":"/index.html"},{"id":"spn-194607","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194608","marks":["code"],"text":"/phases.js"},{"id":"spn-194609","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-194610","marks":["code"],"text":"/say.js"},{"id":"spn-194611","text":" are emitted by "},{"id":"spn-194612","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-194613","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-194614","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-194615","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194616","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-194617","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194618","marks":["code"],"text":"records/contracts/*.contract.json"},{"id":"spn-194619","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194620","marks":["code"],"text":"src/landing.html"},{"id":"spn-194621","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194622","marks":["code"],"text":"src/shell.css"},{"id":"spn-194623","text":", "},{"id":"spn-194624","marks":["code"],"text":"src/phases.js"},{"id":"spn-194625","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-194626","marks":["code"],"text":"src/say.js"},{"id":"spn-194627","text":". "},{"id":"spn-194628","marks":["bold"],"text":"An edit to the served HTML is reverted by the next build — and refused before that"},{"id":"spn-194629","text":", because "},{"id":"spn-194630","marks":["code"],"text":"records/build.json"},{"id":"spn-194631","text":" fingerprints every input and hashes every emitted artifact. Change the record or the template."}]},{"id":"blk-118212","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"npm run test:launch   # re-derive the facts, emit the site, run the gate"},{"id":"blk-118213","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194632","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-194633","text":" reads the emitted artifact and refuses to publish when it and the records disagree: a retracted claim reinstated anywhere outside the retraction, a performance target quoted as a figure, a rung invented, a CTA the "},{"id":"spn-194634","marks":["code"],"text":"spec"},{"id":"spn-194635","text":" rung has not earned, a "},{"id":"spn-194636","marks":["code"],"text":"§N"},{"id":"spn-194637","text":" that resolves to no heading, an unrendered token, a "},{"id":"spn-194638","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-194639","text":", a text token below 4.5:1, a same-origin link that resolves to nothing, a stale or hand-edited artifact, or an identifying-animation constant leaking into the copy. "},{"id":"spn-194640","marks":["bold"],"text":"It has been made to refuse 23 times deliberately, against a throwaway copy, with an unmodified control run first"},{"id":"spn-194641","text":" — the control matters: the first run of that harness reported refusals that were all refusing for an unrelated reason."}]},{"id":"blk-118214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194642","text":"Do not hand-type the check count anywhere; the gate prints its own total."}]},{"id":"blk-118215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194643","text":"Three checks are newer than the rest and are the ones to understand first:"}]},{"id":"blk-118216","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194644","marks":["bold"],"text":"The cascade resolver"},{"id":"spn-194645","text":" (SHELL.md r7/r8). Every contrast check reads a"}]}],"id":"blk-118217","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-118219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194646","marks":["italic"],"text":"declared"},{"id":"spn-194647","text":" token, and r7's header-CTA defect — "},{"id":"spn-194648","marks":["code"],"text":".top nav a"},{"id":"spn-194649","text":" (0,2,1) beating "},{"id":"spn-194650","marks":["code"],"text":".btn"},{"id":"spn-194651","text":" (0,1,0) — passed all of them for as long as it shipped on nine surfaces. The gate parses the emitted markup into elements with their ancestor chains, parses the emitted stylesheet with specificity, source order, "},{"id":"spn-194652","marks":["code"],"text":"!important"},{"id":"spn-194653","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-194654","marks":["code"],"text":"@media"},{"id":"spn-194655","text":", and resolves "},{"id":"spn-194656","marks":["code"],"text":"color"},{"id":"spn-194657","text":" for every button at 390px and 1280px, hovered and not. Cross-checked against the browser's own computed styles for all four buttons: they agreed. It also resolves "},{"id":"spn-194658","marks":["code"],"text":"min-height"},{"id":"spn-194659","text":" on the animation panel, because §8 placement is a computed height and not a string in a stylesheet."}]},{"id":"blk-118220","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194660","marks":["bold"],"text":"Comment stripping is its own pass"},{"id":"spn-194661","text":" (SHELL.md r8), and the page text is"}]}],"id":"blk-118221","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-118223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194662","text":"built by SPLITTING on tags rather than replacing them with a space. The first version shredded every text node into single words, which made every multi-word rule — including \"no signup at the "},{"id":"spn-194663","marks":["code"],"text":"spec"},{"id":"spn-194664","text":" rung\" — silently unfalsifiable. The gate now proves its own extractor on every run."}]},{"id":"blk-118224","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-118226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194665","marks":["bold"],"text":"§10 is counted, never quoted."},{"id":"spn-194666","text":" The blocklist stops the three exact"}]}],"id":"blk-118225","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-118227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194667","text":"strings that shipped; this stops the shape of the defect coming back in another row's words."}]},{"id":"blk-118228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-194668","marks":["bold"],"text":"The band says \"a specification in the ComputeDriven world\", not \"the temporal layer of ComputeDriven\", and that is deliberate."},{"id":"spn-194669","text":" "},{"id":"spn-194670","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-nav"},{"id":"spn-194671","text":" records ticktickclock as "},{"id":"spn-194672","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 3"},{"id":"spn-194673","text":", and its own "},{"id":"spn-194674","marks":["code"],"text":"renderPlacement()"},{"id":"spn-194675","text":" gives the layer sentence to "},{"id":"spn-194676","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 2"},{"id":"spn-194677","text":" only; place 3 gets the specification sentence plus a spec link, place 4 gets attribution alone. Three variants, not two."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierap37al7dmcgbhwbdgyxmxkggpr7dfk34izfaexrpigu6atbxnm7ca","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}